                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.25690/2610.25690v1/teaser.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview of ScaleNav.ScaleNav learns navigation priors from Internet egocentric videos through action-free video pretraining, then uses action-labeled simulated data for action alignment and joint fine-tuning. It jointly predicts future observations and action chunks to follow navigation instructions. The right panel illustrates deployment on a real quadruped robot.",
